---
// The Method, from the author's side. Mirrors LisaMoment (copy left, photo
// right) so the two proofs face each other. Luke's words, from the written
// testimonial he sent Platte (January 2026), trimmed.
---

<section class="section fade-in">
  <div class="wrap">
    <figure class="lk">
      <div class="lk-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Result</span>
        <blockquote class="lk-quote">
          &ldquo;Going in, I had no idea what the structure, rhythm, or sequencing
          should look like. Platte laid out a framework that let the book flow.
          I&rsquo;ve received countless comments on how
          <span class="display-italic">well-structured</span> it is, and
          that&rsquo;s entirely thanks to him.&rdquo;
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="lk-cite">
          Luke Falk
          <span>Former NFL Quarterback &middot; <em>The Mind Strength Playbook</em></span>
        </figcaption>
      </div>

      <div class="lk-photo">
        <div class="lk-frame">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/images/luke-falk-platte.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img
              src="/images/luke-falk-platte.jpg"
              alt="Luke Falk holding his book, The Mind Strength Playbook, beside Platte Clark"
              width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
        <span class="lk-credit">Luke Falk and Platte &middot; The Mind Strength Playbook</span>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lk {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .lk-frame { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  .lk-frame img {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%;
  }
  .lk-credit {
    display: block; margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ink-mute);
  }
  .lk-copy .eyebrow { display: block; }
  .lk-quote {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 1.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2.3rem); line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-ink); text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .lk-cite {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .lk-cite span { display: block; margin-top: 0.35rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-ink-mute); }
  .lk-cite em { font-style: normal; }

  /* The photograph settles out of a slight zoom as it scrolls into view. */
  @keyframes lkSettle { from { transform: scale(1.12); } to { transform: scale(1); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
      .lk-frame img {
        animation: lkSettle linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: entry 0% cover 50%;
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .lk { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .lk-photo { order: -1; }
    .lk-frame img { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-position: 50% 28%; }
  }
</style>
